# Unselected ordinary L2 documentation-tool part; not yet compiled or run.
# Port of the SequenceMatcher path used by tools/build_semantics.py:
# isjunk=None, autojunk=False. Lines have explicit byte lengths. No generic
# LCS, prefix stripping, junk filtering or alternative diff is substituted.
# CPython 3.14 difflib.py 7E447DB5885DD050B1D2EA7C8CB4357490B01342823DD6B956AAA441B47C077E.
# Changes: ordinary L2 arrays replace Python dictionaries/lists; exact byte
# equality replaces Python string equality after the caller's UTF-8 split;
# only the used no-junk/no-autojunk mode and opcode result are retained.
